    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University Institute for Educational Development, East Africa (AKU-IED EA) partnered with the Kenya Educational Management Institute (KEMI) for a momentous occasion - the closing ceremony for 26 participants of the two-year Diploma in Educational Leadership and Management (DELM) programme in Mombasa, Kenya.  The event drew over 55 attendees, including school heads from Kwale and Kilifi counties.",
